#. <CLT 4>もう、こんなモニターなんかに怯えない。
#. モノクマなんか怖くない！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm not gonna let these things scare me anymore... I'm\n"
"not afraid of you, Monokuma!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いつも見てるのか…？
#. それはそれで飽きないのか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Are they always watching us? Don't they ever get tired\n"
"of it...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…と、心の中で挑発するのが精一杯だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, it took everything I had even just to *think*\n"
"about mocking them...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>よく見ると時計の針がない…
#. 今までのはなんだったんだ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That clock...has no hands! How am I just noticing\n"
"that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>分厚い鉄板で隠された窓…
#. その向こうには……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The window's completely covered by that metal plate.\n"
"And just on the other side of it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ帰れるはずだ。
#. いや、絶対に帰ってみせる！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I'll get out of here soon. No...I absolutely\n"
"HAVE to get out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>分厚い鉄板で隠された窓…
#. その向こうには……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The window's completely covered by that metal plate.\n"
"And just on the other side of it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もうすぐ帰れるはずだ。
#. いや、絶対に帰ってみせる！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm sure I'll get out of here soon. No...I absolutely\n"
"HAVE to get out!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>初日に、ボクが突っ伏していた机…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the desk I woke up on when I first got here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あれが始まりで…
#. そして、もうすぐ終わるんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is where it all began... And pretty soon, it'll\n"
"all be over.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0012 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

